# Settings > System > Pointer navigation (pointer navigation spike): the System section with "Pointer navigation: Off"
# (the default), its choice page (Off checked), On picked: back in System with "On" (the harness' config fake keeps
# it), then the choice page again with On checked. Release build (APPLAUNCH_DEV 0), no board profile.
# Review only: no golden. No header check of the choice page: its title is cut with dots on the smaller screens (the
# same as "On-screen keyboard"), and the check looks for the whole text.
title settings pointer navigation
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
launch Settings
# System: Up from Screen wraps to the last section
key UP
key ENTER
# System (release): Storage, Licenses, About, Pointer navigation, SSH indicator, On-screen keyboard, Reboot, Shutdown;
# Up wraps from the top
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
wait 300
shot pointer_setting_off
key ENTER
wait 300
shot pointer_choice_off
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot pointer_setting_on
key ENTER
wait 300
shot pointer_choice_on
